          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " came and stood forth, calling as at other times, “Samuel! Samuel!” And Samuel said, “Speak, for thy servant hears.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Samuel, “Behold, I am about to do a thing in Israel, at which the two ears of every one that hears it will tingle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "On that day I will fulfil against Eli all that I have spoken concerning his house, from beginning to end. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I tell him that I am about to punish his house for ever, for the iniquity which he knew, because his sons were blaspheming God,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3.13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Another reading is",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "for themselves",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and he did not restrain them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore I swear to the house of Eli that the iniquity of Eli's house shall not be expiated by sacrifice or offering for ever.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
